{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Which was in the days of Abraham.</b> For from then until now there had been no famine as severe as this one — so severe as to drive the inhabitants of the land to leave it, as Abraham did." "<b>And Isaac went to Abimelech.</b> To obtain permission from him as a matter of proper conduct, since he intended then to leave his land because of the famine."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:47.735415582Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}